notes.diagram:
flowchart LR
  REQ([API request]) --> SCP{SCP allows principal?}
  SCP -->|no| DENY[Denied]
  SCP -->|yes| RCP{RCP allows resource access?}
  RCP -->|no| DENY
  RCP -->|yes| IAM{Identity or resource policy allows?}
  IAM -->|no| DENY
  IAM -->|yes| OK[Allowed]

flowchart LR
  W([Steady baseline usage]) --> Q{Will family or Region change?}
  Q -->|yes, or uses Fargate, Lambda| CSP[Compute SP: up to 66%]
  Q -->|no, fixed family| ESP[EC2 Instance SP: up to 72%]
  W --> DB{Database fleet?}
  DB -->|yes| DSP[Database SP: up to 35%]

flowchart LR
  V1[Blue: current version] --> LB{Traffic shift}
  LB -->|10% canary| V2[Green: new version]
  V2 --> AL{Alarms healthy?}
  AL -->|yes| ALL[Shift remaining 90%]
  AL -->|no| RB[Roll back to blue]
